# Keep baseline + reference map; ignore nightly snapshots & reports
# (they accumulate fast — the scheduled task commits them to main directly)
schema-2*.json
drift-2*.md

# Task hygiene sweep working files. NEVER commit these — this repo is public and
# the work-list carries full inbound email bodies, tenant names, rent figures and
# phone numbers. Only the redacted task-sweep-{date}.md report is tracked.
task-sweep-worklist-*.json
task-sweep-decisions-*.json
task-sweep-applied-*.json
task-sweep-pending.json
task-sweep-pending-*.json
# Unredacted companion to the nightly report: names people, suppliers and exact
# sums so Kevin can act. Local only — the tracked .md report stays redacted.
task-sweep-detail-*.md
